{"id":"48fc86014ba6508f","group":"73","path":"73/73-thm-cfg-ambiguity-ordered-derivations.md","title":"语法树歧义与有序推导歧义等价","display":"thm-cfg-ambiguity-ordered-derivations — 语法树歧义与有序推导歧义等价","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-thm-cfg-ambiguity-ordered-derivations","aliases":["73-thm-cfg-ambiguity-ordered-derivations"],"display":"thm-cfg-ambiguity-ordered-derivations — 语法树歧义与有序推导歧义等价","depends_on":["[[73-df-cfg-ordered-derivation-histories]]","[[73-df-cfg-ambiguity]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§5.4.3, Theorem 5.29, print p. 213; PDF p. 235; rightmost analogue proved by symmetric traversal","source_status":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":5},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-thm-cfg-ambiguity-ordered-derivations"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-thm-cfg-ambiguity-ordered-derivations</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-cfg-ambiguity-ordered-derivations — 语法树歧义与有序推导歧义等价"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c3c84ebd86018553\" href=\"?note=c3c84ebd86018553\" title=\"73-df-cfg-ordered-derivation-histories\">73-df-cfg-ordered-derivation-histories</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a3d61b5dd7be385b\" href=\"?note=a3d61b5dd7be385b\" title=\"73-df-cfg-ambiguity\">73-df-cfg-ambiguity</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§5.4.3, Theorem 5.29, print p. 213; PDF p. 235; rightmost analogue proved by symmetric traversal"},{"key":"source_status","html":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"5"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_\\Sigma\">\\(G\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_\\Sigma\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in\\Sigma^*\">\\(w\\in\\Sigma^*\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Hist}\">\\(\\operatorname{Hist}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{AmbiguousAt}\">\\(\\operatorname{AmbiguousAt}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Unambiguous}\">\\(\\operatorname{Unambiguous}\\)</span> 取已列依赖。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{AmbiguousAt}(G,w)\\Longleftrightarrow|\\operatorname{Hist}_{G,\\mathsf{lm}}(w)|\\ge2\n\\Longleftrightarrow|\\operatorname{Hist}_{G,\\mathsf{rm}}(w)|\\ge2.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{AmbiguousAt}(G,w)\\Longleftrightarrow|\\operatorname{Hist}_{G,\\mathsf{lm}}(w)|\\ge2\n\\Longleftrightarrow|\\operatorname{Hist}_{G,\\mathsf{rm}}(w)|\\ge2.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Unambiguous}(G)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall w\\in\\Sigma^*\\;|\\operatorname{Hist}_{G,\\mathsf{lm}}(w)|\\le1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Unambiguous}(G)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall w\\in\\Sigma^*\\;|\\operatorname{Hist}_{G,\\mathsf{lm}}(w)|\\le1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>树按从左到右的待展开变量遍历，唯一决定最左历史；反向逐步展开最左未展开变量叶，唯一恢复树。最右情况取相反遍历次序。第一次不同的产生式位置保留在树和历史两边，且自环、单位规则及空规则都作为真实步骤保留。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-cfg-ordered-derivation-histories","status":"resolved","id":"c3c84ebd86018553","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-cfg-ordered-derivation-histories]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-cfg-ambiguity","status":"resolved","id":"a3d61b5dd7be385b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-cfg-ambiguity]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"G\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"w\\in\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Hist}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{AmbiguousAt}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Unambiguous}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{AmbiguousAt}(G,w)\\Longleftrightarrow|\\operatorname{Hist}_{G,\\mathsf{lm}}(w)|\\ge2\n\\Longleftrightarrow|\\operatorname{Hist}_{G,\\mathsf{rm}}(w)|\\ge2.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Unambiguous}(G)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall w\\in\\Sigma^*\\;|\\operatorname{Hist}_{G,\\mathsf{lm}}(w)|\\le1.","display":true}],"bytes":1645,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-95","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-thm-cfg-ambiguity-ordered-derivations|语法树歧义与有序推导歧义等价]] （本轮新建）"}],"outgoing":["c3c84ebd86018553","a3d61b5dd7be385b"]}